<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Guess the Agent</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <meta name="description" content="Sayori is a Discord bot with fun trivia, guessing, and leaderboard commands.">

  <!-- Bootstrap + AOS -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    crossorigin="anonymous">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sayori.css">

</head>

<body>
  

  <header class="text-center py-5" data-aos="fade-down">
    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Guess The Agent</h1>
    <p class="lead">Agent Black • Agent White • Agent Red</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-center">

    <div class="container my-5">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up">How to play</h2>
      <div>
        <ul>
          <li>Use `!gta` to start the game, and react to the embed. <br>
          </li>
          <div class="mx-auto" style="
    max-width: 762px;
    aspect-ratio: 762 / 555;
  ">
            <img src="/gif/gta-join.gif" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit: contain;" alt="Demo" />
          </div>
          <!-- <img class="img-fluid" style="max-width: 762px;" src="/gif/gta-join.gif" alt=""> -->

          <li>Once you react to the embed you will recieve a DM confirming your entry.</li>
          <li>Now that you are in game, wait for the game to start or ask the host to use <code>!gta begin</code></li>
          <li>
            When the game starts, you will recieve either one of these message in DM:
            <ul>
              <li>
                You are an **Agent**. Your secret word is: **{word}**
              </li>
              or
              <li>You are **Agent White**. You have **no word**. Pretend you have one!</li>
            </ul>
            Once you have recieved your word, the game starts.
          </li>

        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>





  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aos@2.3.4/dist/aos.js"></script>
  <script>AOS.init();</script>
</body>

</html>